  "description": "Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.8 / stable ABI 8 repair test build. Xayah and Yone encyclopedia cards now use 64x64 finished-hero-class full-body textures drawn directly in post_render over the real native encyclopedia icon rectangles; the rejected source-created child-node route is retired, and a zero or failed target can never hide the stock icon. Battle, BP and compact portrait cameras are unchanged. Yone keeps one reference-grounded native eight-frame run action, a moderate alternating stride and stable ground anchor, but now has a clearer canonical screen-right travelling silhouette so the game's native flip_x visibly mirrors his body when movement changes side instead of reading as the same frontal zombie pose. Fate Sealed keeps its staged wind-up, launch, knock-up, dual-slash and pull/echo presentation aligned to the real rush tick. His pure-data Q/W/R kit has no active E; retired native names remain no-op saved-season compatibility shims. Shen stays on the repaired original Q/W/R contract. All nine data_champion definitions, BP chrome and illustrations, Rift map/towers/Nexus, HUD art, announcer audio and BP/match music remain active. A fresh test save is required only for the previously introduced current Yone action tree.",
